{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2023-04-19 12:30:00', 'title': 'INVESCO REAL ESTATE LAUNCHES HOMESTEAD COMMUNITIES, A NATIONAL MANUFACTURED HOUSING PLATFORM', 'text': 'DALLAS , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INVESCO REAL ESTATE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT BUSINESS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE LAUNCH OF HOMESTEAD COMMUNITIES, A REAL ESTATE OPERATING COMPANY.\xa0HOMESTEAD COMMUNITIES IS DEDICATED TO ADDRESSING THE AFFORDABLE HOUSING CRISIS IN THE U.S. BY PROVIDING SAFE, CLEAN, AND SUPPORTIVE COMMUNITIES FOR WORKING FAMILIES AND RETIREES WHERE THEY CAN OWN OR RENT AFFORDABLE, HIGH-QUALITY, SINGLE-FAMILY MANUFACTURED HOMES.'}